   282	| 8. Expansion gate | Decide Brand breakout, PMax funding and remarketing rebuild | Add coverage only where measurement and budget are sufficient |
   283	
   284	No Google Ads health score should be calculated from the current snapshot. The required 30-day Search Terms Report is available, but the remaining applicable audit checks, longer history and supporting reports are not complete.
