31:- Complete an Australian privacy review before activating the landing page, Meta Pixel/CAPI, CRM audiences or offline conversion uploads.
32:- Do not collect injury details, symptoms, diagnoses or other health information in advertising forms.
33:- Use only controllable-output claims. Do not claim guaranteed injury prevention, assured WHS compliance or quantified claims reduction.
34:- Any awards, Danone reference, client logos, “ASX 100” statement or 5.0/63-review claim remains **client sign-off required** and cannot enter ads or landing pages until verified.
35:- Wherever offered, the free 15-minute Workplace Ergonomics Risk Snapshot must carry the adjacent statement: **“Preliminary guidance only—not a compliance assessment, compliance certification, medical assessment or diagnosis.”** If the format cannot carry it, that format must not mention the Snapshot.
