316:- Maintain close keyword, ad and landing-page message match.
317:- Refresh or formally reassess Search creative every **8–12 weeks**.
318:- Investigate creative or message-match deterioration if Quality Score drops by **two or more points**; Quality Score itself is a diagnosis flag, not a business KPI.
