811:| Priority | Asset batch | Purpose |
813:| 1 | Manual Handling Training RSA set and matched landing-page hero | Improve the dominant existing demand path |
814:| 2 | Dedicated landing-page modules and compliant Snapshot blocks | Replace generic-page message mismatch |
