864:| Measurement quality | Reported conversions include newsletter and soft actions; no qualified-lead import exists | Clean primary conversion set and offline qualification loop |
865:| Target economics | Target CPA, qualified-lead value, contract value and delivery margin are unknown | Agree target cost per qualified lead and CAC ceiling |
866:| Consent and privacy | CMP, **Consent Mode v2, default denied, with no client- or server-side analytics/advertising transmission before consent**, privacy notices and cross-business data boundaries not assessed | Australian privacy review and documented implementation scope |
867:| Physiotherapy separation | Shared-account conversion and reporting boundaries require validation | Campaign-level conversion goals, separate GA4/pixel/GTM scope and QA |
868:| Creative decisions | No clean baseline supports kill or scale directives | Use conditional diagnosis after qualified-lead data exists |
869:| LinkedIn ABM | Named-account list, deal economics and minimum viable test budget are unknown | Validate account universe, economics and sales follow-up capacity |
870:| PMax and remarketing creative | Paused campaign assets and historical performance were not provided | Audit before deciding whether to fund, rebuild or park |

