   106	Decision: use only if the budget must remain flat. Meta’s A$600 budget passes both the delivery floor and the provisional A$424.60 learning-budget check for one ad set. Treat this as a controlled baseline-establishment test because the Snapshot-request CPA is assumption-based and commercial lead economics remain unknown.
