   142	
   143	| Check | Formula | Result | Status |
   144	|---|---|---:|---|
   145	| Meta delivery floor | A$20/day × 30 | A$600 per 30-day planning period per ad set | Scenarios 1–3 pass with one ad set |
   146	| Raw Search enquiry CPL | A$4,246 last-30-day Search spend ÷ approximately 20 real leads | A$212.30 | Conservative upper-bound sensitivity only—not the Meta target-CPA anchor |
   147	| Assumed Snapshot-request CPA range | A$212.30 × assumed 25%–40% lower-friction-event factor | A$53.08–A$84.92 | Assumption-based pending clean Meta Snapshot-request data |
   148	| Provisional Meta target CPA | Conservative upper end of assumed Snapshot-request CPA range | A$84.92 | Planning anchor only—not a qualified-lead or profitable-acquisition target |
