   303	### RSA construction rules
   304	
   305	Per ad group:
   306	
   307	- Create at least **8 unique headlines** and **3 descriptions**.
   308	- Aim for **12–15 genuinely distinct headlines** where message quality permits.
   309	- Keep headlines to **30 characters** and descriptions to **90 characters**.
   310	- Target “Good” or “Excellent” Ad Strength as a diagnostic.
   311	- Use minimal, strategic pinning.
   312	- If pinning is necessary, provide two or three variants for each pinned position.
   313	- Leave headline position three unpinned.
   314	- Do not pin all positions.
   315	- Add at least four sitelinks and four callouts, plus structured snippets and relevant image assets.
   316	- Maintain close keyword, ad and landing-page message match.
   317	- Refresh or formally reassess Search creative every **8–12 weeks**.
   318	- Investigate creative or message-match deterioration if Quality Score drops by **two or more points**; Quality Score itself is a diagnosis flag, not a business KPI.
