142:| `view_service` | Consulting service page viewed after consent | `service_type`, `page_path_clean`, `cx_funnel_step`, `schema_version` | GA4; consented audiences | Secondary |
143:| `form_start` | User begins an approved Consulting form | `form_name`, `offer_type`, `service_type`, `event_id`, `schema_version` | GA4, Meta | Secondary |
