    19	The shared Google Ads account also contains Physiotherapy activity. ErgoWorks Consulting measurement must be isolated from Physiotherapy, ErgoEquip and Biosymm through campaign-specific conversion goals, separate platform datasets, a Consulting-only GA4 stream, and tightly scoped GTM triggers.
