   149	| `proposal_sent` | A priced proposal is issued | `lead_id`, `event_id`, `proposal_id`, `value`, `currency=AUD`, `event_time`, `schema_version` | Google Data Manager, Meta CAPI, CRM | Secondary |
   150	| `closed_won` | Finance/CRM confirms a won engagement | `lead_id`, `event_id`, `deal_id`, approved contribution or revenue value, `currency=AUD`, `event_time`, `schema_version` | Google Data Manager, Meta CAPI, CRM | Revenue outcome |
   151	| `newsletter_signup` | Separate marketing subscription completed | `event_id`, `consent_timestamp`, `schema_version` | GA4 and approved marketing system | Secondary only |
